            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.29

- Lyrics now use depth of field: the line being sung stays sharp while the rest fall progressively out of focus, so your eye lands on the current line immediately.
- Refined the full-screen layout. The artwork is larger, and the track title, progress bar, and times now sit in a block slightly wider than the artwork rather than being constrained to its exact width, which gives the whole panel better proportions.
- Lyrics are set in a heavier weight for a bit more presence.
]]></description>
